# Vendored third-party benchmark comparands. Excluded deliberately: these are
# other authors' libraries (SwiftCast ships its own LICENSE) and redistributing
# them under this repo is a licensing decision, not a packaging one.
# Consequence: the comparative benchmarks in tests/Profiling that reference them
# will not run on a fresh clone until they are supplied locally.
tests/Profiling/FastCast2/
tests/Profiling/SwiftCast/

